    "text": "69 applications. 20 first interviews. 1 signed contract.\n\nEvery one of those applications used to mean the same hour of work. Read the posting, open your CV, cut the parts that don't fit, rewrite the summary, upload. Then do it again tomorrow for a posting that closes on Friday. https://t.co/bWG4QSq8Ad",
