    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "2 details that make it better than a prompt chain.\n\nIt compiles the PDF and looks at it, fixing orphaned titles and cover letters spilling to page 2 until the layout is clean. Then it extracts the PDF text layer the way an ATS parser reads it and scores keyword coverage against",
