    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "The author's own note is the useful part: output quality tracks profile depth almost entirely. A thin profile gives generic applications.\n\nWhich is the whole game with AI. What you put in front of it decides what comes out:\n\nhttps://t.co/0Z9r9x1nFU",
